ngm:etsi-domain-infrastructure-interop a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "ETSI_Domain_Infrastructure___Interop"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "ETSI infrastructure interoperability domain providing standardised frameworks enabling disparate systems, services, and domains to exchange data and operate cohesively across organisational boundaries. It underpins cross-domain data integration through NGSI-LD interfaces, intent-based network management, spectrum sharing frameworks, and EU Data Act Article 35 mandates for centralised interoperability standards repositories."@en ;
