    rdfs:label "Plotting a graph using matplotlib python library"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A Logseq-embedded Python code example demonstrating inline data visualisation using matplotlib within a Pyodide runtime. The snippet generates a sinusoidal plot, encodes it as a base64 PNG, and returns it for display inside the knowledge graph note, illustrating programmatic data visualisation within a personal knowledge management environment."@en ;
