    rdfs:comment "Prime Intellect is an open-source decentralised AI research organisation and GPU compute marketplace founded by Vincent Weisser (CEO, formerly co-founder of VitaDAO and AI lead at Molecule biopharma) and Johannes Hagemann headquartered in San Francisco, operating on 4M total funding across three ..."@en ;
