    rdfs:comment "Vircadia is an open-source, community-governed, self-hostable Metaverse platform forked from High Fidelity's codebase under the Apache 2.0 licence, providing a federated architecture for persistent, spatially-aware virtual worlds with support for desktop and VR Headsets clients, posit..."@en ;
