    rdfs:label "Meeting Recording"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Persistent capture and archival of synchronous virtual or physical meetings—comprising video, audio, screen share, and transcript streams—stored in cloud platforms or on-premises repositories for asynchronous playback, compliance audit, onboarding, and AI-mediated analysis."@en ;
