ngm:storytelling a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Storytelling"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The craft and practice of structuring narrative content to communicate meaning, emotion, and experience to an audience. In spatial computing and metaverse contexts, storytelling encompasses interactive narrative design, world-building, and immersive experience creation that leverage real-time 3D environments to place participants inside the story."@en ;
