    rdfs:comment "Hyperledger Indy is the purpose-built, permissioned, Byzantine-fault-tolerant distributed-ledger project hosted by the Linux Foundation-resident Hyperledger Foundation (now consolidated under the LF Decentralized Trust umbrella since June 2024) that provides the canonical reference implem..."@en ;
