    rdfs:comment "An optoelectronic sensor device that detects electromagnetic radiation in the infrared spectrum (wavelengths approximately 700 nanometers to 1 millimeter) to measure heat emission, enable proximity detection, support autonomous navigation, or facilitate object recognition in robotic systems, empl..."@en ;
