    rdfs:label "Virtual Economy Infrastructure"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "The collection of technologies, platforms, and systems essential for creating, managing, and sustaining economic activities within metaverse environments, including blockchain networks, payment systems, marketplaces, and decentralized finance protocols."@en ;
