    rdfs:label "Bitcoin Environmental Issues"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "Bitcoin Environmental Issues refers to the multi-dimensional ecological footprint generated by Bitcoin's Proof of Work (PoW) consensus mechanism and the extensive ASIC mining hardware infrastructure that sustains it."@en ;
