    rdfs:comment "A Domain Ontology is a formal, explicit, machine-readable specification of a shared conceptualisation restricted to a delimited subject domain (clinical medicine, financial instruments, cultural heritage, manufacturing robotics, gene products, scholarly publications, e-commerce products), followi..."@en ;
