ngm:runtime-environment a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Runtime Environment"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "A Runtime Environment provides the execution context in which application code runs, managing memory allocation, code interpretation or compilation, system resource access, and cross-platform compatibility. In spatial computing, runtime environments span browser-based JavaScript engines with WebXR and WebGPU APIs, native frameworks such as Unity's IL2CPP and Unreal's C++ runtime, and standards such as WebAssembly that enable near-native performance across diverse hardware."@en ;
