    rdfs:comment "A cooperative arrangement in which multiple miners aggregate their computational resources to increase the probability of successfully mining a block, sharing the resulting block reward proportionally to contributed hash rate. Mining pools reduce variance in miner income but introduce centralisation risks."@en ;
