    rdfs:comment "AI Risks is the umbrella ontological category denoting the full taxonomy of potential and realised adverse impacts arising from the design, development, deployment, integration, or societal embedding of artificial intelligence systems, spanning four canonical risk-source domains—misuse (intention..."@en ;
