    rdfs:comment "An Access Control System is the assemblage of policies, decision engines, enforcement points, identity providers, attribute sources, audit pipelines, and cryptographic primitives that determines wher a subject (human user, service account, autonomous agent, device) is permitted to perform a r..."@en ;
