    rdfs:comment "Infrastructure component serving as the unified northbound entry point for client requests into a Distributed System|distributed or Microservices|microservices backend, providing cross-cutting policy enforcement (request routing across hundreds-to-thousands of upstream services, authentic..."@en ;
