    rdfs:comment "A Hash Function is a deterministic computational mapping H: {0,1}* → {0,1}^n from arbitrary-length input strings (preimages, messages) to fixed-length output strings (digests, hashes, fingerprints) of n bits (typically n ∈ {128, 160, 224, 256, 384, 512}), whose security and utility derive fro..."@en ;
