    rdfs:label "AML KYC Compliance"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "AML KYC Compliance is the composite regulatory and operational discipline by which obligated entities — banks, payment institutions, e-money issuers, brokers, insurers, accountants, lawyers, art dealers, casinos, real-estate agents, virtual-asset service providers (VASPs / crypto-asset service pr..."@en ;
